[b]1、 Content adjustment[/b]
[list]
[*] It can be resurrected after the first death in low difficulty;
[*] You can unlock heroes with magic crystals;
[*] Increase the bonus of magic crystal in adventure mode. The lower the difficulty, the more it increases;
[*] Increase the reward of training dummys in adventure mode by 50% over the original;
[*] Two new cards can be unlocked for any adventure victory.
[/list]

[b]2、Bugs[/b]
Fixed 5 bugs about cards, items and achievements.

Last updated on 20th Dec 2019.
Event
1、	Added 3 new events: Adventurer’s Storehouse, Magic Crystal Mine, Tomb of the Brave.
-[ Adventurer’s Storehouse]: You can exchange your card here with those card left by other players.
-[ Magic Crystal Mine]: Scramble for chunks of Magic Crystal.
-[ Tomb of the Brave]:Other player’s grave. You can rummage for something useful, or show respect.
2、	Optimized some events;
Cards
1、[Crystal Sphere] : changed rarity Epic to Rare;
2、[Flamedragon's Horn] :  changed rarity Rare to Epic;
3、[Snake Gloves] : changed from 3 cost to 2 cost;
4、[Leading Spear] : changed from 3 cost to 2 cost;
5、[Cursed Eye] : changed from 2 cost to 1 cost;
6、[Wind Crossbow]: effect changed to "Whenever a friendly Token enters or leaves the battlefield." ; 
7、[Mini Catapult] : changed to “1 cost(0 cost after upgrade):Destroy a friendly minion, and deal damage equal to its Attack  to the enemy.”;
8、[Naga Sea Witch]: lower the HP from 16 to 14. Upgrade this card won’t get Attack and HP bonus now;
9、[Breeze Charmer] : fixed a bug that cause Breeze Charmer won’t work correctly;
10、[Titan of Sea] : fixed a text problem.
Items
Added 8 new items.
1、[Air-dried Starfish] ：At the start of each combat, if your HP is lower than 50%, draw 2(3 after upgrade) additional cards;
2、 [Treant Sprout] : At the start of each combat, if your HP is lower than 50%, max mana +1(and mana +1 after upgrade);
3、[Herbal Pouch]: At your first turn, whenever you use a card, HP+2(+4 after upgrade) ;
4、[Arcane Matryoshka]: At your first turn, whenever you use a non-token card, put a copy of it into your hand;
5、[Adventure Diary]: if you hold this item, you will get 150(300 after upgrade) bonus Proficiency.
6、[Holly Ritual Ring]: (Shaman only) Curse can now be played. Whenever you play a Curse, HP +1. Future card rewards have 1 less cards to choose from;
7、[Voodoo Pipe]: (Mage only) Curse cards can now be played. Whenever you play a Curse, deal 1 damage to the opponent;
8、[Crimson Coral]: (Witch only) Curse can now be played. Whenever you play a Curse, draw a card. Future card rewards have 1 less cards to choose from.
Others
1、Fixed the bug that when AI immolated Curse cards, it occasionally make game break down;
2、New year, new version and new looks for following monsters: (Diamond Dragon, Master of Arcane, Time Magician, Forest Dwarf, Abaddon Devil of War, Geomancer, Fel Sorcerer, Mammon Devil of Famine, Elven Ranger, The Curator, Blue Drake, Green Drake, Flame Spirit.);
3、Fixed some achievement text that doesn’t read smoothly;
4、Fixed the bug that sometimes the tips of Moon Well will be blocked by map elements;
5、Lower the price of [Purify] and [Purify(Greater)] in “Runestones”.

1、Added Battle Video speed adjustment. Now you can adjust Battle Video speed in Setting. There are "Normal Speed/Fast Speed/Extreme Speed" for you to choose;
2、Added Restart bottom. Now you can Restart current battle in Menu;
