Event
1、Fixed the bug that [Titanic Ward+] got in Event doesn't have Innate;
2、Optimized initial event [Dragon Hunter];
Achievement 
1、Fixed the bug that players can achieve [Last Judgment],
[The Reaper] and [Cursed! Cursed! ];
